  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFID MHSP Malawi Health Sector Programme Techincal Assistance Component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This agreement is support to the UK funded Malawi Health Sector Technical Assistance Project (MHSP-TA) by contirbuting to the programme&#x2019;s flexible fund.The Flexible Fund is a funding mechanism jointly managed by MHSP-TA, the Ministry of Health (MoH) and DFID. Its purpose is to provide the MoH, DFID and other health sector&#x2019;s partners with a flexible and rapid response to address emerging health system strengthening issues with both TA and programmatic support.</narrative>
  </description>
